    <string name="about_title">About Duzup</string>
    <string name="about_body">Duzup keeps track of your bills, events, tasks, notes, birthdays and routines, and nudges you at the right time.\n\nIt works fully offline. No account, no server, no analytics.\n\nFonts: Inter and Pixelify Sans, both under the SIL Open Font License 1.1.</string>
