    <string name="privacy_row_hint">Everything stays on this phone</string>
    <string name="privacy_body">Everything you enter stays on this phone, in the app\'s private storage.\n\nDuzup has no internet permission, no account, no ads and no tracking. Nothing is ever uploaded.\n\nBackup files you export aren\'t encrypted. Anyone who can open the file can read it, so keep it somewhere safe.</string>
